OL,3,GNEWSACharities and businesses wrestle
OL,4,Awith diesel cost
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharities and businesses across the
OL,7,FNorth East have said they are
OL,8,Fstruggling with the rising cost of
OL,9,Fdiesel.
OL,11,FThe average price of diesel has risen
OL,12,Fabove #2 a litre in the UK for the
OL,13,Ffirst time, according to the RAC
OL,14,Fmotoring group.
OL,16,FOver the past seven months, the Iran
OL,17,Fwar has severely disrupted the
OL,18,Fproduction and transportation of
OL,19,Fwholesale oil and refined products from
OL,20,Fthe region, causing prices to surge
OL,21,Fworldwide.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
