OL,3,GNEWSACharities and businesses wrestle
OL,4,Awith diesel cost
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe North East cancer charity Daft as a
OL,7,FBrush said it could no longer afford to
OL,8,Fupgrade its diesel vehicles to electric
OL,9,Fas they grappled with filling them up,
OL,10,Fwhilst Teesside Minibus Hire said
OL,11,Fsoaring prices were "not sustainable".
